Solos & Unaligned
Solo and Unaligned are special roles that aren't part of the Townsfolk or Werewolves team. Solo roles are their own team and must be eliminated by both Townsfolk and Werewolf teams. If there are multiple solo teams, they cannot win together. Unaligned players do not have a team. Some of them may be able to win the game without ending it, whilst others join one a team during the game. They don't have to be killed by the other teams; if a team wins and their win condition isn't fulfilled, they lose whilst alive.
